A bounded executor should receive:

- one step objective;
- allowed tools and inputs;
- expected output schema;
- completion criteria;
- prohibited actions;
- time, token, tool, and money budgets;
- maximum action and retry counts;
- current progress state;
- escalation policy;
- provenance requirements.

